{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42948","headline":"婕妤怨 · 张烜","name":"婕妤怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贱妾裁纨扇，初摇明月姿。\n君王看舞席，坐起秋风时。\n玉树清御路，金陈翳垂丝。\n昭阳无分理，愁寂任前期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张烜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}